## What's next

Once you confirm v0.1 works, come back and we'll build:

- **Stage 2** — Workout charts, calendar view, PRs detection (small visual upgrades on what already exists)
- **Stage 3** — Claude-powered weekly review (the AI coach reads your week and writes a debrief)
- **Stage 4** — Whoop OAuth + nightly sync (recovery & HRV inform the coach)
- **Stage 5** — Goals (outcome + process, with AI-suggested plans)
- **Stage 6** — Diet & recipes
- **Stage 7** — Calendar, tasks, life events
- **Stage 8** — Cross-domain synthesis ("how did sleep affect my running pace this month?")

